{{Quote|My parents are bantha herders. They did not understand my interest in machines. But, they sold their most prized bantha calves so I could become a great engineer.|Neeku Vozo, to [[Nenavakasa Nalor]]|<ref name="The Engineer">{{Resistance|The Engineer}}</ref>}}
The [[Kadas'sa'Nikto]] [[Neeku Vozo]] had '''parents''' who were [[bantha herder]]s. Although not comprehending Vozo's fascination with machines, they sold their most prized [[bantha]] calves so that their son could become an [[engineer]], which he would become on the ''[[Colossus]]''.<ref name="The Engineer" />

